{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃2》昨晚播出第7集，Oscar（方智弘）極搶手被4位女神睇中。</p><p>4位睇中Oscar的女神分別為Kanis（俞可程）、Roxanne（何沛珈），以及新加入的隱藏女神Yvette（陳星妤）及梁超怡。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T09:19:54.382714+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T08:34:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T15:38:05.911910+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T09:17:49.525248+00:00","content_hash":"01669b0ca73507b9ec34940987861341a8f1bc68aec21d009955c48254d5a81f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}